<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>SYNAPSE — a living map of glioblastoma research</title>
<meta name="description" content="An interactive tool that turns real, current PubMed literature into an explorable network — search a gene or drug, see what's connected, and build your own map. Built by Snigdha Sarthak.">
<meta property="og:title" content="SYNAPSE — a living map of glioblastoma research">
<meta property="og:description" content="Search a gene or drug and watch real PubMed literature turn into an explorable network. Built by Snigdha Sarthak.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="SYNAPSE — a living map of glioblastoma research">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="Search a gene or drug and watch real PubMed literature turn into an explorable network.">
